        Tofu shortcuts                                                    
                                                                          
        TOFU ACTIONS                                                      
        These work after the terminal sends the key to tofu.              
          Search         ctrl+k                                           
        >  Commands       alt+k                                           
          Settings       not set                                          
          Models         ctrl+l                                           
          Quote selection  ctrl+r                                         
          Edit in editor  ctrl+g                                          
          Prompt history  ctrl+p                                          
                                                                          
        Press a shortcut for Commands                                     
        Press a shortcut, Esc to cancel, Backspace to clear.              
                                                                          
        Host editors may still intercept a chosen key.                    
                                                                          
        ↑↓ choose · enter edit · bksp clear · esc                         
                                                                          

